12. The following point are arises for consideration is as follows;
1. Whether the prosecution proved beyond all reasonable doubt that after marriage of CW1 with accused they resided at No.175, 1st Cross, V.Nagenahalli, within the limits of Hebbala Police Station,
Bengaluru City wherein the accused started ill-treating CW1 by suspecting her character, abused and beaten her, subjected her to mental and physical cruelty and thrown her out of the house and thereby resulted in commission of an offence punishable u/Sec.498(A) of IPC?
